{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50874","headline":"省题诗二十一首 曲江春望 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 曲江春望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暇日来南陌，春晴望曲江。\n地方骈绮席，城过拂霓幢。\n宝塔摇铃铎，云楼辟璅窗。\n落风花片片，掠水燕双双。\n游女红银䡝，王孙白玉缸。\n莫论仙禁里，祗此见雄邦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}